    # "With my hand on her back, I pointed towards the door at the end of the hallway which Nijah nervously headed towards,"
    "背中に手を置いたまま、私は廊下の突き当たりの扉を指さすと、ニジャは怯えながら歩き出した。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/nijah_rescue/scr_nijah_rescue_3.rpy:39
translate ja evscr_nijah_rescue_3_16d764cf:

    # "With her hand on the door handle, she anxiously looking back at me again to be sure, to which I once again waved to tell her go in."
    "ドアノブに手をかけながら、彼女は不安そうにまた振り返って確かめ、それに応えて私はもう一度手を振って中に入るよう伝えた。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/nijah_rescue/scr_nijah_rescue_3.rpy:41
translate ja evscr_nijah_rescue_3_b77d275d:

